  "sourceUrl": "https://www.idx.co.id/StaticData/NewsAndAnnouncement/ANNOUNCEMENTSTOCK/From_EREP/202608/20260822_KUKI_E025B_c74994e7-b794-45fd-ae77-070735b5ce3a-20260822161903.pdf",
