  "sourceUrl": "https://www.idx.co.id/StaticData/NewsAndAnnouncement/ANNOUNCEMENTSTOCK/From_EREP/202608/20260822_AADI_E0X3_ad85a90b-9ccd-4d05-9534-a765dea22f66-20260822152211.pdf",
